# ============================================================================== 
# GITIGNORE WHITELIST SYNTAX REFERENCE 
# ============================================================================== 
# 
# HOW THIS WHITELIST WORKS: 
#   1. `*` ignores every file and directory by default. 
#   2. `!*/` un-ignores directories ONLY (trailing `/` = folder). Git will not 
#      look inside an ignored directory for whitelisted files unless that 
#      directory is un-ignored first. 
#   3. `pkg/` and `src/` re-ignore makepkg build folders so Git never descends 
#      into them to match copied PKGBUILD, .install, or .desktop files. 
#   4. Rules are evaluated top-to-bottom; the LAST matching rule wins. 
#   5. Already-tracked files ignore these rules until removed from the index 
#      with: `git rm -rf --cached <path>` 
# 
# WHITELIST PATTERN EXAMPLES: 
#   !filename              -> Track exact filename anywhere in the repo 
#   !*.ext                 -> Track all files with extension anywhere in repo 
#   !dir/filename          -> Track one specific file inside `dir/` 
#   !dir/*.c               -> Track all `.c` files directly inside `dir/` 
#   !dir/**                -> Track ALL files and subfolders inside `dir/` 
# 
# WILDCARD QUICK REFERENCE: 
#   *   = Matches anything EXCEPT a slash `/` (single folder level only) 
#   **  = Matches across multiple directory levels recursively 
#   /   = At the start: anchors to repo root. At the end: matches directories only 
#   !   = Negates (un-ignores) a previously ignored pattern 
# ============================================================================== 

# 1. Ignore everything by default 
* 

# 2. Allow Git to traverse subdirectories (required for subfolder whitelists) 
!*/ 

# 3. Block any logs that are burried in some of these config files

# Ignore everything
*
.vim/.netrwhist

# ...even if they are in subdirectories
!*/


# But not these files/directories...
!.gitignore
!dotbot
!install.conf.yaml
!install
!.xinitrc
!.Xresources
!.bashrc
!.vimrc
!.vim
!.vim/*
!.vim/*/*
!.vim/*/*/*
!.vim/*/*/*/*
!.vim/*/*/*/*/*
!.vim/*/*/*/*/*/*
!.gitconfig
!.irssi/*
!.dir_colors
!.fonts
!.config/*/*/*/*/*
!.colors
!.colors/*
!.colors/*/*
!.colors/*/*
!.urxvt/*/*

!test1
!testfolder/*/*
